WEBVTT

00:00:28.143 --> 00:00:30.434
Ako ste ikada
preživjeli prirodnu katastrofu,

00:00:30.434 --> 00:00:32.476
bili zlostavljani ili izolirani,

00:00:32.476 --> 00:00:33.851
ustanite.

00:00:33.851 --> 00:00:37.101
Ako ste ikada imali spontani pobačaj,

00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:38.934
ako ste ikada abortirali

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:41.893
ili ste se borili s neplodnošću,

00:00:41.893 --> 00:00:43.518
molim vas, ustanite.

00:00:43.518 --> 00:00:46.934
Konačno, ako ste se vi,
ili bilo tko koga volite,

00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:50.643
morali nositi s
mentalnom bolešću, demencijom,

00:00:50.643 --> 00:00:53.149
nekim oblikom tjelesnog oštećenja,

00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:54.643
ili sa suicidom,

00:00:54.643 --> 00:00:57.125
molim vas, ustanite.

00:00:57.125 --> 00:00:58.976
Pogledajte oko sebe.

00:00:58.976 --> 00:01:04.268
Nesreća ne diskriminira.